      "instance_name": "racial_dehumanization",
      "label": "Racial Dehumanization",
      "description": "The meme relies on the concept of racial dehumanization, which involves portraying a racial group as less than human or as not authentic. This is achieved by using the blonde wig as a visual metaphor to suggest that Black people are not 'real' or are being replaced by white people. This concept is rooted in historical and systemic racism and is used to justify discrimination and hostility.",
