      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_001",
      "label": "Textual statement mapped onto visual object",
      "description": "The text 'we should respect blacks' is juxtaposed with the visual of a blonde wig on a mannequin head, creating an analogical mapping where the text implies the wig represents 'blacks' who are not authentic or are being replaced by white people. This mapping is central to the meme's hateful intent, as it uses the visual object to symbolize the group referenced in the text, thereby perpetuating racial dehumanization.",
